config-connector-extensions patch 0004: mockgcp serves regional Secret Manager secrets and their versions.

For secretmanager.gcp.hfl.dev SecretManagerSecret with spec.location and
its SecretManagerSecretVersion. secrets.go and service.go carry Config
Connector's open pull request #6651 (head 9aab204d), applied by hand to
master's text (master changed proto.Clone to proto.CloneOf around it):
a secret's parent may be projects/<p>/locations/<l>, a regional secret
needs no replication, and the us-central1 regional endpoint is served.
secretversions.go is ours: the PR's fixture has no regional version, so
its mock never names one; a version's name may now carry the location.

Upstream candidate: secrets.go and service.go are upstream's; the
secretversions.go part should go with the PR.

